\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {17.2}{\ignorespaces The compound structure construction. The same component can be seen, for $n_i,n_o$ and $M$. Multiple consecutive components construct some components, and further outward. Also, we also reflect the complexity of $\mathcal {C}$ for a given architecture.}}{285}{figure.caption.125}%
